            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "meta-google/recipes-google/networking/gbmc-bridge.bb",
                    "line": 234,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Yuxiao Zhang",
                        "email": "yuxiaozhang@google.com",
                        "username": "zyxiaooo"
                    },
                    "message": "need to remove @"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-google/recipes-google/networking/gbmc-bridge.bb",
                    "line": 234,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "William A. Kennington III",
                        "email": "wak@google.com",
                        "username": "wak-google"
                    },
                    "message": "yeah, must have missed that in translation from my original commit."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-google/recipes-google/networking/gbmc-bridge/gbmc-br-dhcrelay.service",
                    "line": 8,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Yuxiao Zhang",
                        "email": "yuxiaozhang@google.com",
                        "username": "zyxiaooo"
                    },
                    "message": "any concerns of using always?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-google/recipes-google/networking/gbmc-bridge/gbmc-br-dhcrelay.service",
                    "line": 8,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "William A. Kennington III",
                        "email": "wak@google.com",
                        "username": "wak-google"
                    },
                    "message": "When it starts the first time, it will exit success since you can't run the daemon without interfaces. I guess I could just make the script sleep indefinitely?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-google/recipes-google/networking/gbmc-bridge/gbmc-br-dhcrelay.service",
                    "line": 8,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Yuxiao Zhang",
                        "email": "yuxiaozhang@google.com",
                        "username": "zyxiaooo"
                    },
                    "message": "maybe we can disable it by default and start it only in the hook? Then we can use always"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-google/recipes-google/networking/gbmc-bridge/gbmc-br-dhcrelay.service",
                    "line": 8,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "William A. Kennington III",
                        "email": "wak@google.com",
                        "username": "wak-google"
                    },
                    "message": "You could still have the interface go down and remove itself and end up with the empty list again. If you really want always we could just make it sleep indefinitely in that case instead of launching dhcrelay."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-google/recipes-google/networking/gbmc-bridge/gbmc-br-dhcrelay.service",
                    "line": 8,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Yuxiao Zhang",
                        "email": "yuxiaozhang@google.com",
                        "username": "zyxiaooo"
                    },
                    "message": "Yeah then let's do that, I think we want to make sure the service can always run regardless how dhcrelay exited."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-google/recipes-google/networking/gbmc-bridge/gbmc-br-dhcrelay.service",
                    "line": 8,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "William A. Kennington III",
                        "email": "wak@google.com",
                        "username": "wak-google"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                }
            ],
